      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The lion appears to be stalking a hapless quarry that remains completely unaware of the danger lurking nearby.",
          "grammar": "appear to be＋現在分詞 / 関係代名詞that / 現在分詞",
          "ja": "ライオンは、近くに潜む危険に全く気づいていない不運な獲物に忍び寄っているようです。",
          "type": "gist",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Concealed among the tall grass, the predator watches the antelope from a relatively short distance.",
          "grammar": "過去分詞構文",
          "ja": "背の高い草の中に身を隠し、捕食者は比較的近い距離からアンテロープを見つめています。",
          "type": "detail",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The unsuspecting antelope appears preoccupied with the ground near the waterhole rather than the threat behind it.",
          "grammar": "appear＋形容詞 / rather than",
          "ja": "無警戒なアンテロープは背後の脅威ではなく、水場近くの地面に注意を向けているようです。",
          "type": "detail",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "By keeping its body low, the lion exploits the surrounding vegetation as natural camouflage.",
          "grammar": "By＋動名詞 / as",
          "ja": "体を低く保つことで、ライオンは周囲の植物を自然のカモフラージュとして利用しています。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The antelope's lack of vigilance makes it particularly vulnerable to a sudden ambush.",
          "grammar": "make＋O＋C",
          "ja": "アンテロープの警戒不足によって、突然の待ち伏せに特に弱い状態になっています。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Should the lion move within striking distance, it may attempt to pounce before its quarry has time to react.",
          "grammar": "仮定法倒置 / may / before",
          "ja": "もしライオンが攻撃可能な距離まで近づけば、獲物が反応する時間を得る前に飛びかかろうとする可能性があります。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "For the hapless quarry, detecting the concealed predator in time could determine whether it escapes or becomes prey.",
          "grammar": "動名詞主語 / whether A or B",
          "ja": "不運な獲物にとって、隠れた捕食者を間に合うよう発見できるかどうかが、逃げ切れるか捕食されるかを左右する可能性があります。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The scene vividly illustrates how predation depends on stealth, timing, camouflage, vigilance, and the ability to evade attack.",
          "grammar": "how節 / 並列",
          "ja": "この場面は、捕食が隠密性、タイミング、カモフラージュ、警戒、攻撃を回避する能力に左右されることを鮮明に示しています。",
          "type": "gist",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Overall, the image provides useful practice in describing a hapless quarry, predatory behavior, stalking, ambush, vulnerability, vigilance, camouflage, and the struggle for survival.",
